<title>FINLAND: Hartwall sees good profitability.</title>
<headline>Hartwall sees good profitability.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish beverages maker Oy Hartwall Ab said on Thursday its profitability would continue to develop positively.</p>
<p>&quot;We estimate that the profitability of the Hartwall group will continue its present positive trend,&quot; Hartwall said in a statement with its 1996 results.</p>
<p>Hartwall's 1996 profit after financial items rose to 207.5 million markka ($41.3 million) from 45.7 million the previous year. ($ = 5.020 Finnish Markka)</p>
